WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.060
My name is Rose. It's quiet in the house now. I can't see so well and the phone confuses me so I

00:08.060 --> 00:16.980
leave it alone. My glasses wander off. Did I take my pills? I'm never sure. Odd calls, odd letters.

00:17.360 --> 00:24.680
I miss my daughter. I just wanted someone kind to talk to. Then my daughter set up buddy.

